      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 2002 .NET \"XML Web Services\" (SOAP based messaging)\n    - Basis of SOA\n\n- 2008 - Microsoft said ALL network apps should be WCF (windows communication foundation) and WCF is SOAP.\n\n- SOAP was never as big as we thought it was. \n\n\n\n\n\"WCF Rest Toolkit - \nASP.NET MVC (rip off of Ruby on Rails)\nWCF - WCF Web API - Models, View, Controller\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 2002 .NET \"XML Web Services\" (SOAP based messaging)\n    - Basis of SOA\n\n- 2008 - Microsoft said ALL network apps should be WCF (windows communication foundation) and WCF is SOAP.\n\n- SOAP was never as big as we thought it was. \n\n\n\n\n\"WCF Rest Toolkit - \nASP.NET MVC (rip off of Ruby on Rails)\nWCF - WCF Web API - Models, View, Controller\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
